    "covers": "100 in-tree modules: the topic build (scripts/build_topic.py), the pipeline that computes every effect and its endpoint binding, the page and manuscript renderers, the two-limb publication gate, the canonical JSON and SHA-256 routines every digest in this certificate is computed with, this certificate builder, and the replay driver CI runs against it. A change of one byte in any of them moves analysis_code_sha256 and release_sha256.",
